    "Wait until Backup Status says “Backed up” before removing or reinstalling Muslim 5. Prayer history and Period Mode ranges sync privately through your iCloud account. Salah Circle remains separate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sebelum menghapus atau memasang ulang Muslim 5, tunggu hingga Status Pencadangan menunjukkan “Sudah dicadangkan”. Riwayat salat dan rentang Mode Haid disinkronkan secara pribadi melalui akun iCloud. Salah Circle tetap terpisah."
          }
        }
      }
